  "term": "transvestism",
  "definition": "Transvestism is a diagnosis in which a heterosexual male has repeated, strong sexual arousal, urges, or behaviors linked to wearing clothes typically associated with another gender. It is considered a disorder when these experiences lead to significant distress or problems in social, work, or other important areas of life.",
